            "heading": "",
            "text": "Good work email is short, clear and easy to act on: a specific subject line, the request in the first lines, the needed context after it and a polite closing that states the next step and any date."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Start with the ask, add only the context needed and end with the next step."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Check how your team writes and follow its style."
          }
